(potatoes) <peel>
    <slice, thinly>
(cheddar cheese) <grate>
(butter) <melt, in (pot)>
Slowly add (flour), stirring constantly.
After 2 minutes or when bubbly, remove the mixture from the heat.
Add (milk) slowly while stirring constantly.
{sauce} + (cheddar cheese) 3/4
    <season, with (salt) + (pepper), to taste>
Repeat [
    (potatoes) <layer, thinly, in (baking dish)>
    {sauce} <layer, over potatoes>
    (bacon) <put, over the sauce>
]
until there are no more potatoes or sauce
{potato bake} <top, with (cheddar cheese), remaining 1/4>
    <bake, in (oven), 45m>
